FOREWORD = [
 ("h1","A message from our CEO","front_ceo",""),
 ("p","When I joined ACE, people described our management systems as a shelf: an HSE system, an integrity system, a quality system, a maintenance system and a stack of procedures, each with its own owner, language and audit. Each was good on its own. Together they made it harder than it should have been to know what to do."),
 ("p","That is why we built **OMS — our One Management System**. It is not a new layer on top of the old ones. It *is* how ACE works: one framework, one Risk Matrix, one set of documents and one way of checking that we are doing what we say. Risk management, process safety, asset integrity, maintenance, control of work, management of change, emergency response and the rest all live inside OMS."),
 ("p","OMS is built on the industry framework published by IOGP and IPIECA, and it is ready for the international standard for operating management systems that ISO is now developing. More importantly, it is built around our own assets: the platforms in the Gulf of Paria, our land leases, the Central Processing Facility, and the 300 people and many contractors who keep them running safely."),
 ("p","I ask three things of every one of you. Know the OMS duties in your role. Use the current procedure, and if it is wrong, get it fixed. And stop the job if you are not sure it is safe. You have my full support when you do."),
 ("p","**Satesh Sankar**, Chief Executive Officer, Acme Caribbean Energy Limited"),
]

